2. Embedded & Source-Integrated Third-Party Mods and Libraries
--------------------------------------------------------------
To provide a seamless multi-version experience, `theladscore.jar` embeds or source-integrates
several open-source and non-commercial community mods and libraries. Those components are NOT
placed into the public domain and remain under their original authors' copyright and licenses:

- LGPL-3.0-only / LGPL-3.0-or-later / LGPL-2.1-only:
  - Entity Texture Features (ETF) & Entity Model Features (EMF) by Traben (LGPL-3.0-only)
  - ImmediatelyFast by RK_01 (LGPL-3.0-or-later)
  - Fast IP Ping by Fallen_Breath (LGPL-3.0-only)
  - FixBookGUI by KosmoMoustache (LGPL-3.0-only)
  - TabTweaks by MicrocontrollersDev (LGPL-3.0-only)
  - Capes by Cael (LGPL-2.1-only)
  - NBT Autocomplete by MT (LGPL-3.0-only)
  - JvmDowngrader by wagyourtail (LGPL-3.0-or-later, 1.8.9 build)
  Complete modified source code for all LGPL-licensed integrations is bundled directly inside
  every `theladscore.jar` under `META-INF/lads-sources/`.

- MPL-2.0:
  - Hovering Hotbar by Fuzs (MPL-2.0)
  Complete modified source files for MPL-2.0 integrations are bundled inside `theladscore.jar`
  under `META-INF/lads-sources/`.

- MIT / Apache-2.0:
  - Controlling & Clumps by Jaredlll08 (MIT)
  - EntityCulling by LogisticsCraft (OcclusionCulling, MIT)
  - Ksyxis by VidTu (MIT)
  - LazyAI, Optimized Cushions, QuickPack, World Play Time, Screenshot to Clipboard (MIT)
  - ServerPingerFixer (MIT)
  - CatConfig & CatConfig-MC (MIT, bundled in 26.2/26.3)
  - Signal Loss by Hexandcube (Apache-2.0)
  - Screenshot Viewer by LGatodu47 (MIT)
  - Reflect (`net.lenni0451:Reflect:1.6.2`) by Lenni0451 (MIT, bundled in 1.21.11)
  - Google Gson (Apache-2.0, shaded in 1.8.9), SLF4J (MIT, shaded in 1.8.9), SpongePowered Mixin (MIT, 1.8.9)
  - java-objc-bridge by Steve Hannah (Apache-2.0, bundled in 26.2/26.3)

- CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0 (Minecraft 26.2 and 26.3 builds):
  - Jade (`snownee.jade.*`) by Snownee is source-integrated in the 26.2 (`v26_2`) and 26.3 (`v26_3`)
    builds for native HUD/tooltip integration and addon API compatibility. License texts are bundled
    under `assets/theladscore/licenses/Jade-NOTICE.txt` and `assets/theladscore/licenses/Jade-CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.txt`. Use and redistribution of the 26.2/26.3
    Jade integration is strictly non-commercial under CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.

See `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt`, `META-INF/lads-sources/`, and `assets/theladscore/licenses/` for full attributions and license texts.